    "text": "The operator asked (2026-11-11) whether traditional library practice offers anything this research workstream is missing. A Scout reviewed bibliography, citation, source evaluation and review methodology; Council `t_0007` (architect, red-team, strategist; two model families) then advised what to include. The operator ruled: **API-based citation chaining is in scope and a good idea**, the archive is captured **as a page with a clear label** so it is searchable and readable by people, and the rest of the Council's advice stands."
  }
